  23. A person who fails to report on the operational performance of a hunting ground, in violation of Article 53(3);
  24. A person who fails to report or submit data, or submits a false report or data, in violation of Article 56(1).
  (4) An administrative fine under paragraphs (1) through (3) shall be imposed and collected by the Minister of Climate, Energy and Environment, Mayors/Do Governors or heads of Sis/Guns/Gus, as prescribed by Presidential Decree. <Amended on Jul. 23, 2010; Oct. 1, 2025>
